  "term": "dilemma",
  "definition": "A dilemma is a form of reasoning that combines a hypothetical statement with an either-or statement, so that more than one possible condition leads to the same conclusion. In older and popular use, it also means being forced between two alternatives, often where either choice leads to an unwelcome result.",
